  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLet @ and # be '+'\n\nLet * be '×'\n\nSo,\n\n105 @ 100 * 6 # 7 = 712 ⇒ 105 + 100 × 6 + 7 = 712\n\n⇒ 105 + __**100 × **____**6**__ + 7 = 712\n\n⇒ __**105 + 600**____** + 7**__ = 712\n\n⇒ 712 = 712 (LHS + RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n108 @ 80 * 15 # 60 = 1368 ⇒ 108 + 80 × 15 + 60 = 1368\n\n⇒ 108 + __**80 **____**×**____** 15**__ + 60 = 1368\n\n⇒ __**108 + 1200**____** + 60**__ = 1368\n\n⇒ 1368 = 1368 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n60 @ 45 * 16 # 25 = ? ⇒ 60 + 45 × 16 + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ 60 + __**45 ×**____** 16**__ + 25 = ?\n\n⇒ __**60 + 720**____** + 25**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **805**** **\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
